: Anthropic Messages API stream with two degenerate tool_use blocks: the first
: receives input fragments that never assemble into JSON, the second receives
: no input at all. Both have to reach the agent loop as tool calls with usable
: arguments, because the alternative is a turn that dies holding a half-parsed
: block.
:
: Transcribed from
: anthropic::tests::tool_input_that_is_not_json_degrades_to_a_string_argument.

